ageBody is the reply body we get the snippet \n- These are the values for ;\n    \"hotelKey\": \"terrace_green\",\n    \"propertyName\": \"Terrace Green\",\n    \"propertyEmail\": \"sales.terracegreen@gmail.com\",\n    \"source\": \"addon\",\n    \"agentEmail\":{{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.To }} \n- you can derive the sender name from the fromEmail\n- Original SUbject : {{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.Subject }}\n\nNow process:\n\naction: {{ $json.output.action }}\nsummary: {{ $json.output.summary }}\nmessageId: {{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.id }}\nthreadId: {{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.threadId }}\nfromEmail: {{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.From }}\nsnippet (MessageBody) (reply body to the previous message): {{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.snippet }}\nPrevious Message: {{ $json.output.reply.body }}\n",
